TITLE 1D exchange transport problem
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -length 1
    -boundary_conditions constant flux
    -print_cells 8
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 8
    -punch_frequency 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -initial_time 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file exch8.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -head Step CaX2
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, MOL("CaX2")